  "cards": [
    { "dot": "emerald", "title": "How it works", "items": [
      "POST /v1/extract (or the dashboard, or an MCP tool) normalizes the URL, reuses a fresh cached result, else debits credits and writes an extraction row",
      "In worker mode the API only inserts a job; the Railway worker claims it with FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED (3 parallel slots)",
      "Worker: SSRF-guarded Playwright capture → screenshots/HTML/CSS to R2 → per-section Claude synthesis via OpenRouter, merged into the row as each section lands",
      "No AI key or a failed section → deterministic measured engine fills it in; light/dark mode is always the measured value",
      "Clients poll /v1/extract/:id/result; Style Search ranks a 65-brand index; Adherence extracts both pages and scores them"
    ] },
    { "dot": "cyan", "title": "What happened (Oct 5–6, 2026)", "items": [
      "Built as a Canopy Labs product line cloning Taste Engine's UI from 46 screenshots + a screen recording (Canopy logo, DM Sans/Mono)",
      "Full API lifecycle, MCP server, two agent skills and a TS SDK; e2e acceptance suite per task (tests/e2e)",
      "Deployed: Vercel web + Railway worker + Neon + R2; domain brand.trycanopy.space; Railway moved to IaC with preserve()",
      "Production verification: 41/41 e2e, 50/50 API smoke, 12/12 extraction evals"
    ] },
    { "dot": "rose", "title": "Shortcomings", "items": [
      "Clerk runs on a development instance: 'Development mode' label, 100-user cap (production blocked by domain ownership)",
      "Stripe keys not set: paid plans send an upgrade request instead of checkout",
      "UI parity 96.7% design vs the 97% target; Style Search thumbnails and tastelabs font drift",
      "Single worker service, no autoscaling; Neon restore window is 2 days",
      "Brand viewer can jump to top if scrolled within ~1s of load; local AI key has no credit"
    ] },
    { "dot": "amber", "title": "Next (see docs/PENDING.md)", "items": [
      "Roll the pasted Clerk sk_live key",
      "Share the canvas Clerk production app before a public launch",
      "Add Stripe keys + webhook, then test checkout",
      "New Railway worker variable → also add NAME: preserve() to .railway/railway.ts"
    ] }
  ]
